{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the frozen world of <strong>Xylaris-9</strong>, you are a customizable robotic craftsman operating in your high-tech <strong>assembly lab</strong>. Your mission: <strong>design, build, and deliver robots</strong> tailored for the needs of four influential factions <strong>The Syndicate, The Federation, The Nomad Collective</strong>, and <strong>The Eclipse Authority</strong>. <br> <br> <br>Each faction sends specialized robot requests. Analyze their requirements, prepare the ideal blueprint, and craft precise models using advanced materials, sofwares and hardwares. Complete contracts to earn credits, strengthen your relationships, and unlock research opportunities that expand your production capabilities. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.poster.avif?t=1768636859\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.webm?t=1768636859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.mp4?t=1768636859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br>Advance through four <strong>software types</strong> \u2014 <i>Warrior, Assistant, Medic,</i> and <i>Worker</i> \u2014 each with unique performance multipliers. Upgrade your <strong>Materials,</strong>\u00a0<strong>Engines, Processors,</strong> and <strong>Memory Units</strong>\u00a0to maximize crafting points and efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely: power your <strong>Crafting Tubes</strong>, upgrade your <strong>storage bays</strong>, and deploy one of four specialized <strong>cargo ships</strong>, each with distinct capacity and efficiency. Smart logistics and balanced crafting are the keys to success on Xylaris-9. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.poster.avif?t=1768636859\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.webm?t=1768636859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.mp4?t=1768636859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>But not all clients are noble. A mysterious <strong>villain faction</strong> occasionally seeks your creations for darker motives. Whether you choose to serve them or stay loyal to your partners will shape your legacy. <br> <br><strong>Craft with purpose. Trade with precision. Build your robotic future on Xylaris-9.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088760?t=1768636859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/ebfa08ba26455e2ac8fd557c6112e239d7c7019f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768636859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/63e0c49ddc5583fc9e9dd933aa183f4385a8a304/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768636859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/63e0c49ddc5583fc9e9dd933aa183f4385a8a304/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768636859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Fa